WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.303
Today is three small words. They share one heart part.

2
00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:10.565
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.065 --> 00:00:13.644
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:17.606
There are four moves. You will use the same four on every day.

5
00:00:18.056 --> 00:00:19.652
Say the first word. Is.

6
00:00:20.102 --> 00:00:22.782
Tap one finger for each sound. Two taps.

7
00:00:25.395 --> 00:00:31.495
The first letter plays fair. The last letter does not. In this word it buzzes. That is the heart part.

8
00:00:31.945 --> 00:00:38.684
On the page, your child traces the gray word, puts a dot under the fair letter, and draws a heart under the heart part.

9
00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:42.243
The next two words end the same way. Listen for the buzz.

10
00:00:49.002 --> 00:00:50.060
The word is has.

11
00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:58.068
Then step away. For job two, press play on the listening track. Your child reads each sentence, hears it, and marks it.

12
00:00:58.518 --> 00:01:02.277
Then your child writes the number of each sentence beside its picture.

13
00:01:02.727 --> 00:01:08.368
Job three is a word hunt. At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
